      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "OTTO ROSE (8) turned in a plain effort last time when sixth at Sandown over 515m behind Stream It (30.15) in a Grade 5. Goes well out of this box with a win and two minor placings. Should be very hard to beat this time. AUSTRAL WARRIORS (7) turned in a good run last time, finishing in the placings (24.77) at this track in a Mix 6/7. Lines up from box 7 for the first time. Form at the trip sound including two wins. Must be included in calculations. STOMPER ROMPER (1) carved over from wide out and boxed on strongly to finish a neck away in second (29.02) behind Pleasant Dreams at this track. Didn't win last time but still ran one of the quickest times on the card. Nicely placed to grab a well-deserved win. LAKEVIEW TURBO (6) gets a chance to improve on an unplaced run at his latest outing at this circuit.",
